# The picker's paging (D1 follow-up): eighteen saved sessions on a 24-row
# screen, whose page is seventeen (`resumePageLimitForRows`,
# `app_session_runtime.zig:1188-1193`: max(rows - 7, 10)). The first page
# ends on `↓ Load more` (`composeLoadMoreRow`, `resume_menu_presentation.zig:417-436`);
# walking down to its last session loads the next (`maybePrefetchMoreSessions`,
# `:2808-2820`). Scope and search keep to the page that is loaded.
